# One-off delivery bundle: it packs billing-app/, android/, flutter_app/ and the
# workflows into a single file for handing over. Everything inside it is already
# tracked here, and GitHub's own "Download ZIP" does the same job, so keeping a
# copy in the repository would only duplicate source and go stale.
# The ready-to-host build of billing-app/ (dist/lavi-dhaba-billing-app.zip) IS
# tracked, because that one is a real deliverable you cannot get any other way.
dist/lavi-billing-source.zip
